Verse 1:
[D]Praise we [A]the [Bm]Lord, [A/C#]who [Bm]made [A]all [G]beauty
[F#m]For [G]all [Em]our [D]senses [Bm]to [Em/G]enjoy;
[D]Owe [Em]we [F#m]our [G]humble [Bm]thanks [G]and [F#m]duty
[D]That simple [A/C#]pleasures [D]never [A]cloy;
[D]Praise we [C#dim]the [Bm]Lord, [A]who [D/F#]made all [G]beauty
[F#m]For all [Em]our [Bm]senses [G]to [Em/G]enjoy.

Verse 2:
[D]Praise Him [A]who [Bm]loves to [A]see [G]young [F#m/A]lovers,
[F#m]Fresh [G]hearts [Em]that [D]swell [A/C#]with [Bm]youthful [D]pride;
[D]Thank [Em]Him [F#m]who [G]sends [A]the [Bm]sun [G]above [A]us,
[D]As bridegroom [Bm]fit [A]to [D]meet [G/B]his [A]bride;
[D]Praise Him [C#dim]who [Bm]loves [D/F#]to see [G]young [Bm]lovers,
[F#m]Fresh hearts [Em]that [Bm]swell [F#m]with [G]youthful [D]pride.

Verse 3:
[D]Praise Him [A]who [Bm]by [A/C#]a [Bm]simple [G]flower
[F#m]Lifts [G]up [Em]our [D]hearts [A/C#]to [Bm]things [Em/G]above;
[D]Thank Him [Em]who [F#m]gives [A]to [Bm]each [G]one [F#m]power
[D]To find [A/C#]a [Bm]friend [A]to [D]know [G/B]and [A]love;
[D]Praise Him [C#dim]who [Bm]by [A]a [D/F#]simple [G]flower
